Markdown is a lightweight markup language that allows you to write using an easy-to-read, easy-to-write plain text format, then convert it to structurally valid XHTML (or HTML).

IT IS EASY TO LEARN AND USE! 

THE FOLLWING ARE BASIC REFERENCES OF MARKDOWN:-
# //IT IS USED FOR HEADING 1 ,BIG ONE
## //IT IS USED FOR HEADING 2 ,SLIGHTKY SMALLER THAN THE HEADING 1
*  * //IT IS USED TO WRITE WORD IN ITALIC
** **//IT IS USED TO WRITE WORD IN BOLD
[link](url) //IT IS USED TO ADD LINKS IN MD FILES
![alt](image) //THIS IS USED TO ADD IMAGE IN FILES
`code` // THIS IS USED TO ADD CODES IN THE FILE
-item //THIS IS USED TO LIST UNORDERED ITEMS
1. item //THIS IS USED TO LIST ORDERED ITEMS
> qoute // THIS IS USED TO ADD QUOTES IN THE FILE
--- //USED TO ADD HORIZONTAL RULE
